---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
const updated = 'June 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Don’t Work Harder handles your email address and data. Short, plain, and honest."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-dwh">
      <div class="prose-dwh privacy-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
        <h1 class="privacy-h1">Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <p>
          This policy is short because the data practice is simple. {SITE.name}
          collects as little as possible and sells nothing.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you sign up, we collect your email address and a label recording which
          form you used (for example, the course or the launch list). We do not ask
          for your name, and we do not require anything else.
        </p>

        <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>
          Your email address is used to send you the content you asked for: the free
          course, occasional articles, and, if you joined the launch list, news about
          the book. The source label is used only to send relevant messages and to
          understand which pages are useful.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>
          Your email address is stored with our email provider, Kit (ConvertKit),
          which processes it on our behalf so we can send you messages. We do not
          sell, rent, or trade your data with anyone, for any reason.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is privacy-first and does not use
          cookies or collect personal data. It tells us, in aggregate, which pages
          are read. It does not track you across the web. This is why you will not
          see a cookie banner here.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          Every email includes a one-click unsubscribe link, which removes you
          immediately. You can also ask us to delete your data entirely. To make any
          request about your data, reply to any email we send you.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes in a way that matters, we will update the date above
          and, where appropriate, tell you by email.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-body { margin-inline: auto; }
  .privacy-h1 { margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .updated { color: var(--color-ink-soft); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>
